{"Title":"An Act relative to employees of private railroads","BillNumber":"S911","DocketNumber":"SD1906","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T16:17:00.353"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T16:17:00.3533333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S911/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Brady, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 911) of Michael D. Brady for legislation relative to employees of private railroads.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tSection 13D of said chapter 265 of the General Laws as so appears is hereby amended by inserting after the word \"employee\" the following words:- to include employees of private railroads delivering a public service.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}